│ together with the companion papers by the same group are invaluable material to make us aware of that part of the    │
│ world which is still at the margins of our cultural, scientific, ethical and political horizons. This set of papers  │
│ and the ones which preceded them on this issue inform us about the actual situations in low-and middle-income        │
│ countries (LMICs), the high potentials for a multifaceted community-based growth of mental health services and the   │
