of consumers and health providers working in partnership on health services planning, delivery and evaluation.          
                                                                                                                        
Review objective:                                                                                                       
1. To synthesise the views and experiences of consumers and health providers of formal partnership approaches that aimed
to improve planning, delivery or evaluation of health services.                                                         
